<title>UK: Four of five Jan Brent cargoes kept - trade.</title>
<headline>Four of five Jan Brent cargoes kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four of five Brent cargoes turning wet on Friday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The fifth, due to load Jan 5-7, went unclaimed and was clocked to Wall Street trader Morgan Stanley, traders said.</p>
<p>A second Jan 5-7 cargo was kept by Wall Streeter J.P. Morgan while the Jan 4-6 Brent was kept by Shell U.K.</p>
<p>Two Jan 6-8 cargoes were kept by Esso and British Petroleum, traders said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
